{{!-- Weapon item sheet — spec section 4c. Must render one top-level element. --}}
<div class="kd20-sheet kd20-item-sheet">

  <header class="kd20-header">
    <img class="kd20-portrait small" src="{{document.img}}" alt="{{document.name}}"
         data-action="editImage" data-edit="img">
    <input class="kd20-name" type="text" name="name" value="{{document.name}}"
           placeholder="Weapon name" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
  </header>

  <section class="kd20-block">
    <h2>Dice</h2>
    <div class="kd20-derived">
      <div class="kd20-field">
        <label for="damage-die">Damage Die</label>
        <select id="damage-die" name="system.damageDie" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
          {{selectOptions choices.dice selected=system.damageDie}}
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="kd20-field">
        <label for="precision-die">Precision Die</label>
        <select id="precision-die" name="system.precisionDie" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
          {{selectOptions choices.diceWithDefault selected=system.precisionDie}}
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="kd20-field">
        <label>In use</label>
        <span class="computed" title="What rolls will actually use">{{system.effectivePrecisionDie}}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="kd20-hint">
      The Precision Die is added on a Decisive <em>or</em> Supreme hit — always a single
      die. Supreme does not double it; it grants a Follow-Up instead.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="kd20-block">
    <h2>Statistics Used</h2>
    <div class="kd20-derived">
      <div class="kd20-field">
        <label for="attack-stat">Attack Stat</label>
        <select id="attack-stat" name="system.attackStat" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
          {{selectOptions choices.stats selected=system.attackStat}}
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="kd20-field">
        <label for="damage-stat">Damage Stat</label>
        <select id="damage-stat" name="system.damageStat" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
          {{selectOptions choices.stats selected=system.damageStat}}
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="kd20-field">
        <label for="reach">Reach</label>
        <input id="reach" type="number" step="1" name="system.reach"
               value="{{system.reach}}" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="kd20-hint">
      Finesse weapons may allow Strength or Dexterity. In v1 pick one here and change
      it when you want the other.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="kd20-block">
    <h2>Properties</h2>
    <input type="text" name="system.properties" value="{{system.properties}}"
           placeholder='e.g. "Parry" — display only in v1'
           {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
  </section>

  <section class="kd20-block">
    <h2>Description</h2>
    {{formInput systemFields.description value=system.description enriched=enriched.description
                toggled=true compact=true disabled=disabled classes="content-sized"}}
  </section>

</div>
